&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GAQ327R183&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a transformational&lt;strong&gt; International Accounts Payable Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to modernise our International AP operations — evolving from a transactional function into an automated, data-driven capability that partners closely with Domestic AP leadership to deliver a seamless global experience. This role also serves as senior business owner and relationship manager for our outsourced Procure-to-Pay (P2P) service provider, representing P2P leadership and driving governance, performance, and continuous improvement. A highly visible role in a fast-moving, high-growth environment demanding agility and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead international AP operations across regions, currencies, entities, and regulatory environments, ensuring accurate, timely, compliant processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute an International AP strategy with Domestic AP leadership, standardising processes while meeting local compliance needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance, Procurement, and Strategic Sourcing on P2P, cash management, supplier experience, and M&amp;amp;A/expansion activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the relationship with the outsourced P2P provider, setting governance frameworks (KPIs, SLAs, QBRs, escalations) and holding them accountable for performance and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead vendor governance routines — reviews, risk mitigation, capacity planning, roadmap alignment — while driving automation and cost efficiency with the provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure outsourced operations maintain strong controls, audit readiness, and data integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally (Finance, Procurement, Treasury, Tax, HR, Technology) to reimagine AP through automation, AI, and process redesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive transformation initiatives that cut manual effort, improve cycle times, and strengthen controls, championing continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and analytics (Databricks platform) to surface trends, risks, and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong controls, SOX compliance, and policy adherence, including international tax, VAT/GST, and withholding rules; own e-invoice regulation strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track KPI/SLA performance (cycle time, accuracy, aging, exceptions, satisfaction) and lead escalation management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the International AP team, building a culture of accountability, collaboration, and strong change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive AP/Finance Operations leadership experience, including significant international AP oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Chartered Accountant degree is mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing outsourced AP/P2P service providers in complex operating environments, with a strong vendor governance and accountability track record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading large-scale AP transformation, automation, and shared services initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of international AP operations, compliance requirements, and multi-entity environments; experience in fast-paced, high-growth organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success implementing AP technologies, ERP platforms, OCR/invoice automation, and AI-enabled solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional analytical, problem-solving, leadership, and stakeholder management skills, with a proven ability to lead organisational change across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business, or related field preferred; CPA or advanced degree a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role will require overlap working with PST hours.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
