&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic account engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with account teams to engage priority accounts, driving strategic opportunities from initial engagement through successful outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field, account, &amp;amp; customer enablement: &lt;/strong&gt;Align customers and the field on the value of Lakebase by equipping AEs and SAs with the messaging and execution motions needed to confidently own accounts without specialist intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
