&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SLSQ327R566&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is seeking a Manager, Marketing Insights Business Partner to serve as the embedded insights partner to the [VP/GM] of EMEA Marketing and their leadership team. This role exists to create leverage: to make marketing performance easier to understand, easier to act on, and easier to improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Director, Marketing Insights, you will bring analytical rigor and a clear point of view to how EMEA plans, forecasts, measures, and improves its work. Beyond reporting on outcomes, you will produce the forecast leadership plans against, hold visibility into how the work itself is running, and help scope and land the pilots that change how we operate. You will partner closely with Marketing Leadership, Campaign Operations, Marketing Platform &amp;amp; Systems, Sales Operations and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the insights partner to the [VP/GM] of EMEA Marketing and their leadership team, delivering the analysis and narrative required for business reviews, QBRs, and pipeline councils, so that leadership forums produce actionable decisions.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a single, trusted view of EMEA marketing performance across a consistent framework of marketing motions, standardizing dashboards and reporting inputs so teams work from a consistent read on what is working, what is not, and where risk is emerging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support functional target-setting model for EMEA, including program, channel, and product-level contribution, and produce the forecast leadership plans that other teams can rely on.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the leading-indicator framework for EMEA, identifying the early signals that predict outcome performance, so that intervention happens while the quarter can still change, rather than being diagnosed after it closes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate performance data into insight, implications, and recommended areas of focus tied to internal milestones and supporting cross-functional requirements within regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own execution telemetry for EMEA, maintaining visibility into how marketing work is actually running through cycle times, throughput, intake, and SLA performance to reduce operational friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase the region&#39;s self-sufficiency in accessing and using performance data by driving practical, repeatable adoption of Genie and reducing dependency on central data teams for routine reporting and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pilot execution, defining the hypothesis, success criteria, and measurement approach before launch, and delivering a clear read at the end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface and codify what is already working in one market or motion so that proven approaches can be picked up elsewhere, and instrument them so the gain stays visible after the initial push.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the planning cycle with the analytical &amp;amp; programmatic inputs that make investment decisions defensible, including historical performance, efficiency by motion, and target-setting inputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify analytical and data risks early, including data quality issues, reporting gaps, and system performance outages, so they are surfaced and addressed before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the region&#39;s voice in the global Marketing Insights function, surfacing regional requirements and gaps so that global frameworks and tooling work in-region rather than requiring local workarounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in GTM strategy and operations, strategy and operations, FP&amp;amp;A, or consulting, ideally in B2B SaaS or enterprise technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of the B2B demand-generation funnel (pipeline, conversion, attribution, channel and program efficiency) and the metrics that connect marketing activity to revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting senior leaders (Director, VP/GM level) in business reviews, QBRs, and planning cycles, with the confidence to bring a clear point of view and not just report numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building forecasting and target-setting models (top-down and bottom-up), including leading-indicator frameworks that predict outcomes before a quarter closes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and measure pilots: defining hypotheses, success criteria, and measurement approaches up front, and delivering a rigorous end-of-pilot read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with operational and process analytics (cycle time, throughput, intake, SLA tracking) to identify and reduce friction in how work gets done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data quality and governance, with a track record of spotting reporting gaps and data risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent storytelling skills, able to turn complex data into concise insights, implications, and recommendations for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and partner across a matrixed organization (Marketing Leadership, Campaign Ops, Marketing Systems, Sales Ops, Finance), with experience driving self-service adoption and enablement. Familiarity with AI-assisted analytics tools (e.g., Genie) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R937&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires a presence in our Tyson’s Corner, VA, office, multiple days per week, on a hybrid schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Outbound Sales Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be an important contributor to our sales leadership team, leading recruiting, pipeline generation strategy and constructive coaching for our Business Development Representatives (BDRs). The ideal candidate will have experience driving pipeline generation, leading sales development teams and working cross-functionally with sales and marketing teams.&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage, develop, and hire a team of outbound Business Development Representatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Sales, Demand Gen, and Marketing leadership to ensure the success of campaigns, while providing constructive input to develop new campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with Sales segments to ensure positive working relationships and maximize the effectiveness of sales development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a place where people love coming to work by maintaining a high level of enthusiasm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Business Development Representatives to translate complex technical concepts into business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize and optimize outbound workflows, ensuring the team operates with high efficiency and maintains a rigorous &quot;cadence of accountability&quot; through CRM hygiene and process discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively monitor the health of the outbound funnel. You won&#39;t just report on the numbers; you will use data to diagnose bottlenecks in the lead-to-opportunity lifecycle and architect creative solutions to fix them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the &quot;playbook&quot; by identifying repeatable patterns of success, allowing the sales development organization to scale predictably as Databricks continues its rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of overall sales experience (e.g. AE), including at least 1-2 years managing an outbound sales development team in a SaaS environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing outbound pipeline generation motion specifically within the Public Sector vertical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for coaching and developing talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly data-driven: constant optimization of activities and outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with Salesforce and Outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success using AI to improve work streams and operating efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Range Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Databricks is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. The pay range(s) for this role is listed below and represents the expected base salary range for non-commissionable roles or on-target earnings for commissionable roles.&amp;nbsp; Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to job-related skills, depth of experience, relevant certifications and training, and specific work location. Based on the factors above, Databricks anticipated utilizing the full width of the range. The total compensation package for this position may also include eligibility for annual performance bonus, equity, and the benefits listed above. For more information regarding which range your location is in visit our page &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/us-pay-zone-mapping.pdf&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
