&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Databricks scales at unprecedented velocity, how we invest our R&amp;amp;D capital—both human and compute—is critical to our scale. We are looking for a Product Finance leader to own R&amp;amp;D capital allocation and engineering operations. You will be a key finance partner to our senior Engineering and Product Operations leaders, with a mandate that spans product-level R&amp;amp;D ROI, global workforce and location strategy, and the rapidly evolving economics of AI-enabled software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive product-level ROI and R&amp;amp;D capital allocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish frameworks to measure product-level ROI across a fast-moving platform like Databricks where engineering velocity is extremely high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operationalize ROI metrics so they directly inform product investment and resource allocation decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define engineering economics in the AI era&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering to model how AI developer tooling and internal token spend scale alongside headcount, quantifying the tradeoff between human capital and compute capital.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the end-to-end cost of AI-enabled engineering, including the second-order impact on cloud spend, and partner with Engineering to optimize investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape global workforce and location strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-year headcount planning across global engineering hubs, balancing cost per hire, talent density, and university recruiting pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Workplace and Facilities leadership to synchronize R&amp;amp;D hiring roadmaps with global real estate strategy and multi-year CapEx planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale R&amp;amp;D finance operations and build the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring systems-level thinking to R&amp;amp;D finance operations, building scalable, automated workflows across headcount management, PO planning, monthly accruals, and SOX audit compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dogfood the Databricks platform to modernize internal finance tooling and deliver self-serve operational visibility to engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor, and scale a high-performing team of finance professionals capable of operating seamlessly across strategic capital allocation and rigorous operational execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Strategic/Product Finance or R&amp;amp;D FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience managing large-scale R&amp;amp;D OpEx, headcount capacity modeling, and multi-site workforce planning within a high-growth enterprise software or cloud company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of partnering directly with senior Engineering, Product Operations, and People/Workplace executives to drive capital allocation and operational rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems-level thinker with a demonstrated ability to re-engineer financial processes from scratch—spanning headcount tracking, procurement, close, and SOX controls—to support rapid scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, leading, and developing high-output finance teams in fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience analyzing cloud dev/test infrastructure and AI tooling/token costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience attributing shared engineering and platform R&amp;amp;D costs across a complex, multi-product portfolio to establish product-level profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on proficiency with SQL, Python, or notebook environments (especially Databricks) to automate reporting and self-serve insights from large operational datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
