&lt;div&gt;While candidates in the listed locations are encouraged for this role, candidates in other locations will be considered.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Databricks is looking for a Senior Financial Analyst to join the Sales Finance (Topline Analytics) team in the FP&amp;amp;A organization. You will report to the Senior Finance Manager.&lt;br&gt;Topline Analytics owns the company&#39;s view of the top line across consumption, bookings, billings, and cash.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will own key parts of the bookings and cash forecasts and work as an extension of Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bookings forecasting - own and refine the bookings forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cash forecasting - build and maintain the cash collections forecast (linking consumption, bookings, and billings)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with sales strategy and sales operations, and provide recommendations to finance leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility role to senior leadership across Finance and Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Economics, Accounting, Finance, or a comparable field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of corporate finance, management consulting, or investment banking experience; familiarity with the software industry (and SaaS) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building financial models independently and preparing recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, organizational, and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience simplifying and scaling while supporting a fast-moving, high-growth business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity to learn and solve problems independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritize objectives in a fast-paced environment to ensure deliverables are met in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in Excel/Google Sheets (can maintain complex spreadsheets); comfortable managing large datasets and driver-based models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience using SQL or willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
