&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we aim to empower our customers to solve the world&#39;s most challenging problems using the Data + AI Platform while putting trusted data and AI in the hands of every business user. As a Senior Scale Solution Engineer, you are a technical anchor for our scaled customer motion, advising customers across many stages of their lifecycle: from pre-sales evaluation through onboarding and into production. You independently take on complex engagements and build and improve AI-augmented workflows that enable the whole team to deliver high-quality guidance at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will ensure customers have an excellent experience by independently owning engagements across their lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be the go-to expert on the Databricks Data + AI Platform, owning technical direction and building reusable AI-augmented workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will work directly with multiple customers concurrently and set the quality bar for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to assess customer needs, foster relationships, address objections, and effectively showcase the value of the Databricks platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree or higher in Computer Science, Information Systems, or similar relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a technical role, preferably in the Data, AI, or Cloud field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of at least one of the following cloud platforms, AWS, Azure, or GCP; familiarity with more than one is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of AI-driven development with programming languages like Python or SQL, including building and extending AI-augmented workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the end-to-end data analytics and data engineering workflow, and their trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management and prioritization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication in &lt;strong&gt;Korean&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Databricks Certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience building AI tooling and automation, consulting or pre-sales, or with agentic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
