&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Flexibility to travel (&lt;strong&gt;up to 50%&lt;/strong&gt;, primarily for customer meetings in Portugal, events, and trainings).&lt;/li&gt;
