&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, building, and managing modern data governance for a modern data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience designing cloud infrastructure and services, such as AWS, Azure, or GCP, applying best practices in cloud security and networking, including:&lt;/li&gt;
