&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;10+ years experience in data transformation and warehousing within enterprise level, distributed data systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
