&lt;li&gt;It is not necessary but good to have understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Databases&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SQL, data warehousing, BI, and analytics use cases&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
