&lt;p class=&quot;first-token&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Recruiter to be the driving force behind hiring the strategic talent that powers our operational engine across AMER — Finance,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; Legal,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; People,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; and the broader Corporate Functions org.&lt;/span&gt; These are the people who partner directly with business leaders, solve our most complex operational and organizational challenges, and make Databricks impossible to compete against. Your job is to find them, win them, and close them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;This is an exciting time to be part of the rocketship and the Databricks expansion across AMER. We&#39;re scaling fast, the bar is high, and the demand for elite corporate and business operations talent has never been more intense. You&#39;ll own full-cycle hiring for some of the most sought-after profiles in the market, partnering directly with Corporate Functions leadership to build teams that don&#39;t yet exist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Recruiters at Databricks are subject matter experts when it comes to talent attraction and are given full autonomy to bring new ideas and creative approaches to life. If you thrive in ambiguity, move fast, and get energy from building in a high-growth, high-pressure environment, read on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for Corporate Functions roles across AMER — Finance,&lt;/span&gt; Legal, People, Workplace, and Corporate leadership — from first outreach to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0&quot;&gt;Partner with Corporate Functions leaders as a true strategic advisor on sourcing strategy, market mapping, competitive intelligence, compensation positioning, and talent insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0&quot;&gt;Activate and engage passive, high-caliber corporate talent — the strategic thinkers and operational leaders who aren&#39;t actively looking but are exactly who we need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,3,0&quot;&gt;Build and sustain engaged talent pipelines that can keep pace with aggressive hiring goals and our continued AMER expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4,0&quot;&gt;Create closing strategies that win against the most competitive offers in the market and manage stakeholder expectations with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,5,0&quot;&gt;Use data to set benchmarks and metrics, drive workforce planning, and continuously sharpen our hiring process as we scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,6,0&quot;&gt;Champion a world-class candidate experience and act as a brand ambassador for Databricks at every touchpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1,7,0&quot;&gt;Play a key role in building a diverse, inclusive, and exceptionally high-caliber workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
