&lt;li&gt;Plan, document, and drive the expansion of Databricks usage in newly landed accounts, turning initial projects into broad, high‑impact data and AI platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify new AI and data use cases in government operations and feed these insights into Canada&#39;s public sector go‑to‑market, influencing product direction and regional strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
