&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Executive - Pharma/Life-Science&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with big data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Strategic Enterprise Account Executive, you will come with an informed and compelling point of view on the Big Data, Advanced Analytics, and AI space, which will guide your successful strategy and, together with both our teams and partners, allow you to provide exceptional value to our customers within the Swiss Pharma/Life-Science sector.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
